This function aggregates the final output of each agent from the convergence workflow to pass it onto the zipper workflow.
Each agent's final output is collected as it goes, tracked by a unique id per council, and updated every time the agent makes a new one, so the last contribution of each agent is always on hand when a vote passes.
The outputs are presented to the zipper labeled by agent and broken into numbered lines, like:
AGENT_NAME
line 1: ~information~
line 2: ~information~
It is implemented as final_output in swarm/functions.py and is reached through the >>FINAL_OUTPUT<< arrow.
